    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>&quot;What do books mean to us? And what happens when the stories we depend on go missing?&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Library Investigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as Ruby (they/them), a journalism major on a surreal, after-hours adventure to investigate the disappearance of books from their college library. Their quest for library justice leads to dark political revelations and a magnetic connection with a mysterious trans librarian. Can Ruby live out their own queer story, even as queer history is being erased?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/extras/ab1923ae5d79db4b5e5438229907d644.poster.avif?t=1750137970\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/extras/ab1923ae5d79db4b5e5438229907d644.webm?t=1750137970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/extras/ab1923ae5d79db4b5e5438229907d644.mp4?t=1750137970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative Puzzling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thought bubbles</strong> provide insight into Ruby's (sometimes scattered) mind, as you make your way through the mysterious MacLeod library. Use an\u00a0<strong>interactive</strong>\u00a0<strong>journal</strong> to focus these thoughts and reveal new insights. The more you learn about Ruby's past, and the queer history of MacLeod itself, the more of the library's secrets you'll unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/extras/5ac685d8d0d70857854872b81ec8a672.poster.avif?t=1750137970\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/extras/5ac685d8d0d70857854872b81ec8a672.webm?t=1750137970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551960/extras/5ac685d8d0d70857854872b81ec8a672.mp4?t=1750137970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>poignant</strong>, timely tale, which intertwines the <strong>personal</strong> &amp; the <strong>political</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>labyrinthine library</strong>, with hundreds of real-world books</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>MetroidBrainia,</strong> where knowledge &amp; insight advance the gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological mechanics</strong>\u00a0allow you to experience the world through Ruby\u2019s eyes</p></li></ul>",
